{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48868","headline":"红蔷薇 · 庄南杰","name":"红蔷薇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九天碎霞明泽国，造化工夫潜翦刻。\n翠叶长眉约细枝，殷红短刺钩春色。\n明日当楼晚香歇，金带盘空已成结。\n谢豹声催麦陇秋，熏风吹落猩猩血。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}